#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:26
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The Bzip2 package contains programs for compressing and decompressing files."
" Compressing text files with <command>bzip2</command> yields a much better "
"compression percentage than with the traditional <command>gzip</command>."
msgstr ""
"O pacote Bzip2 contém aplicativos para comprimir e descomprimir arquivos. "
"Comprimir arquivos de texto com <command>bzip2</command> gera uma muito "
"melhor percentagem de compressão que com o tradicional "
"<command>gzip</command>."

