#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Bzip2"
msgstr "Instalação do Bzip2"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:46
#, xml-text
msgid "Apply a patch that will install the documentation for this package:"
msgstr "Aplique um remendo que instalará a documentação para esse pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:48
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&bzip2-docs-patch;</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&bzip2-docs-patch;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:50
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The following command ensures installation of symbolic links are relative:"
msgstr ""
"O seguinte comando garante que a instalação de links simbólicos sejam "
"relativos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:52
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i 's@\\(ln -s -f \\)$(PREFIX)/bin/@\\1@' "
"Makefile</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i 's@\\(ln -s -f \\)$(PREFIX)/bin/@\\1@' "
"Makefile</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:54
#, xml-text
msgid "Ensure the man pages are installed into the correct location:"
msgstr "Garanta que as páginas de manual sejam instaladas no local correto:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:56
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i \"s@(PREFIX)/man@(PREFIX)/share/man@g\" "
"Makefile</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i \"s@(PREFIX)/man@(PREFIX)/share/man@g\" "
"Makefile</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:58
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Bzip2 for compilation with:"
msgstr "Prepare o Bzip2 para compilação com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:60
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"make\">make -f Makefile-libbz2_so\n"
"make clean</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"make\">make -f Makefile-libbz2_so\n"
"make clean</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:64
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the make parameter:"
msgstr "O significado do parâmetro do make:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:67
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-f Makefile-libbz2_so</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-f Makefile-libbz2_so</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:69
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This will cause Bzip2 to be built using a different "
"<filename>Makefile</filename> file, in this case the <filename>Makefile-"
"libbz2_so</filename> file, which creates a dynamic <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libbz2.so</filename> library and links the Bzip2 "
"utilities against it."
msgstr ""
"Isso causará Bzip2 ser construído usando um arquivo "
"<filename>Makefile</filename> diferente, nesse caso o arquivo "
"<filename>Makefile-libbz2_so</filename>, o qual cria uma biblioteca dinâmica"
" <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libbz2.so</filename> e vincula os "
"utilitários do Bzip2 contra ela."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:79
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile and test the package:"
msgstr "Compile e teste o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:81
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the programs:"
msgstr "Instale os aplicativos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:85
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make PREFIX=/usr install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make PREFIX=/usr install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the shared library:"
msgstr "Instale a biblioteca compartilhada:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:89
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cp -av libbz2.so.* /usr/lib\n"
"ln -sfv libbz2.so.&bzip2-version; /usr/lib/libbz2.so</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cp -av libbz2.so.* /usr/lib\n"
"ln -sfv libbz2.so.&bzip2-version; /usr/lib/libbz2.so</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The name of the shared library isn't standardized and it varies among "
"distros. The instruction above has installed <filename "
"class='libraryfile'>libbz2.so.1.0</filename>, but some applications, for "
"example Kbd, expects a different name <filename "
"class='libraryfile'>libbz2.so.1</filename> that some other distros are "
"using. Create a compatibility symlink for them:"
msgstr ""
"O nome da biblioteca compartilhada não é padronizado e varia entre "
"distribuições. A instrução acima instalou <filename class='libraryfile'>"
"libbz2.so.1.0</filename>, mas alguns aplicativos, por exemplo Kbd, esperam "
"um nome diferente, <filename class='libraryfile'>libbz2.so.1</filename>, que "
"outras distribuições estão usando. Crie um linque simbólico de "
"compatibilidade para eles:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:99
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -sfv libbz2.so.&bzip2-version; "
"/usr/lib/libbz2.so.1</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -sfv libbz2.so.&bzip2-version; /usr/lib/libbz2.so.1</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The symlink approach is only valid here because the library name difference "
"is a result of different aesthetic views of the distro maintainers, not real"
" ABI incompatibilities.  In general a library name difference most likely "
"indicates an ABI incompatibility and it would be very likely invalid to "
"<quote>hide</quote> the difference via a symlink.  Read <xref "
"linkend='pkgmgmt-upgrade-issues'/> for details about library names."
msgstr ""
"A abordagem de linque simbólico só é válida aqui porque a diferença no nome "
"da biblioteca é um resultado de diferentes visões estéticas dos(as) "
"mantenedores(as) de distribuição, não de incompatibilidades reais de ABI. Em"
" geral, uma diferença no nome da biblioteca provavelmente indica uma "
"incompatibilidade de ABI e seria muito provavelmente inválido "
"<quote>ocultar</quote> a diferença por meio de um linque simbólico. Leiam-se"
" <xref linkend='pkgmgmt-upgrade-issues'/> para detalhes acerca de nomes de "
"bibliotecas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the shared <command>bzip2</command> binary into the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/bin</filename> directory, and replace two copies of"
" <command>bzip2</command> with symlinks:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o binário compartilhado <command>bzip2</command> no diretório "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/bin</filename> e substitua duas cópias do"
" <command>bzip2</command> por links simbólicos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:116
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cp -v bzip2-shared /usr/bin/bzip2\n"
"for i in /usr/bin/{bzcat,bunzip2}; do\n"
"  ln -sfv bzip2 $i\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cp -v bzip2-shared /usr/bin/bzip2\n"
"for i in /usr/bin/{bzcat,bunzip2}; do\n"
"  ln -sfv bzip2 $i\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Remove a useless static library:"
msgstr "Remova uma biblioteca estática inútil:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/bzip2.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">rm -fv /usr/lib/libbz2.a</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">rm -fv /usr/lib/libbz2.a</userinput>"

